        "custom": "Pokémon"
      },
      "biography": {
        "value": "<p>O Pokémon Raposa Ardilosa. Zorua assume a aparência de outros seres para surpreendê-los e costuma se transformar em uma criança silenciosa. Para escapar do perigo, ele esconde sua identidade imitando pessoas e Pokémon.</p><p><strong>SR:</strong> 1 &nbsp;•&nbsp; <strong>Nível Mínimo Encontrado:</strong> 1 &nbsp;•&nbsp; <strong>Grupo de Ovos:</strong> Campo &nbsp;•&nbsp; <strong>Gênero:</strong> 88% M / 12% F &nbsp;•&nbsp; <strong>Estágio Evolutivo:</strong> 1/2</p><p><strong>Evolução:</strong> Zorua pode evoluir para Zoroark no nível 10 ou superior. Quando evolui, seus pontos de vida aumentam no dobro do seu nível.</p><h3>Moves por Nível</h3><table><thead><tr><th>Nível</th><th>Moves adquiridos</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td style='text-align:center'>1</td><td>Leer, Scratch</td></tr><tr><td style='text-align:center'>2</td><td>Pursuit</td></tr><tr><td style='text-align:center'>3</td><td>Fake Tears, Hone Claws</td></tr><tr><td style='text-align:center'>5</td><td>Fury Swipes</td></tr><tr><td style='text-align:center'>6</td><td>Feint Attack</td></tr><tr><td style='text-align:center'>7</td><td>Scary Face</td></tr><tr><td style='text-align:center'>8</td><td>Knock Off</td></tr><tr><td style='text-align:center'>9</td><td>Taunt</td></tr><tr><td style='text-align:center'>10</td><td>Foul Play</td></tr><tr><td style='text-align:center'>11</td><td>Torment</td></tr><tr><td style='text-align:center'>13</td><td>Agility</td></tr><tr><td style='text-align:center'>14</td><td>Embargo</td></tr><tr><td style='text-align:center'>15</td><td>Nasty Plot, Punishment</td></tr><tr><td style='text-align:center'>16</td><td>Imprison, Night Daze</td></tr></tbody></table><h3>TMs</h3><p>Aerial Ace, Agility, Assurance, Attract, Bounce, Burning Jealousy, Calm Mind, Confide, Confuse Ray, Covet, Dark Pulse, Dig, Double Team, Embargo, Encore, Endure, Facade, Fake Tears, Fling, Foul Play, Frustration, Grass Knot, Helping Hand, Hex, Hidden Power, Hyper Voice, Imprison, Knock Off, Lash Out, Nasty Plot, Night Shade, Pain Split, Payback, Protect, Psych Up, Rain Dance, Rest, Retaliate, Return, Revenge, Roar, Round, Scary Face, Shadow Ball, Shadow Claw, Skitter Smack, Sleep Talk, Sludge Bomb, Snarl, Snatch, Snore, Spite, Substitute, Sunny Day, Swagger, Swift, Swords Dance, Take Down, Taunt, Tera Blast, Thief, Torment, Toxic, Trick, U-turn, Uproar</p><h3>Egg Moves</h3><p>Captivate, Copycat, Counter, Dark Pulse, Detect, Extrasensory, Memento, Snatch, Sucker Punch</p>",
